        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>So me and a few friends just stumbled upon something that might need to get checked on: &nbsp;Haka had most of Infinitor&#39;s manifestations under savage mana and his last manifestations were on the field. &nbsp;Infinitor&#39;s one shots all make him play the top card of the deck. &nbsp;With this, he just kept playing the top card of his deck over and over and over again in an infinite loop that killed most of the team except for haka and the sentinels who had damage reduction on them so the 1 damage that he deals from some of the cards could not kill him. &nbsp;Now I know he is called the Infinitor, and I know I am a playtester, but seriously how did this slip by EVERYONE? &nbsp;We couldn&#39;t finish the game...</p>",
