        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>One-shots remain in play until all of it&#39;s effects are done. If a one-shot plays another one-shot, the first one-shot will remain in play until the second one completes. If the second one-shot plays another one-shot, the second will remain in play until the third is done. And since the second is still in play, the first card is also still in play. This continues until One-shots stop playing cards that will play another card. So once Infinitor plays ever single one-shot, he&#39;ll stop and put every one-shot in his trash.</p>",
